  "bio": "Daniel Furtado, based in Lisbon, Portugal, is a versatile tattoo artist renowned for his expertise in traditional, dotwork, and illustrative styles. As a resident artist at Triparte Tattoo and a guest at Adiktink Mersch, he maintains an exemplary standard of cleanliness in his practice, ensuring a hygienic environment for his clients while creating art on their skin. His portfolio, a testament to his meticulous approach, can be followed through his exclusive Instagram handle @odanielfurtado.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lisbon, Portugal\n\n😎Segue-me aqui:@odanielfurtado\n✈️🧳🎒🇱🇺:Guest Artist: @adiktink_tattoostudios \n🏠Lisboa🇵🇹",
